2,"title":"Kongsikan Dia","start_date":"13/06/2026","end_date":"19/06/2026"},{"number":13,"title":"Menuju Keabadian","start_date":"20/06/2026","end_date":"26/06/2026"}]},{"id":"2026-03","title":"1 dan 2 Korintus","description":"Menulis surat merupakan aktiviti sepanjang zaman yang tidak menjadi usang. Kita hanya mengubah cara penulisan surat. Ya, media sosial telah menggantikan kertas. Walau bagaimanapun, pada dasarnya, e-mel dan bentuk surat elektronik yang lain pada asasnya mempunyai fungsi yang sama: ia menghubungkan orang ramai dengan bertukar maklumat, perasaan dan pemikiran.","human_date":"Julai · Ogos · September 2026","start_date":"27/06/2026","end_date":"25/09/2026","color_primary":"#605045","color_primary_dark":"#4B3C32","splash":true,"credits":[{"name":"Penerbit Eksekutif","value":"Joihin @ Jim Kango, Kozal Watts Malim Enggang, Daven Lamam"},{"name":"Penyumbang Utama","value":"Adenilton T. de Aguiar"},{"name":"Pengarah Penerbitan","value":"Giftor Jepth Ginda"},{"name":"Penterjemah","value":"Lesaya L. Sorudim, Rayners L. Sorudim"},{"name":"Konsep Kulit/Rekacipta Dalaman","value":"Lesaya L. Sorudim"}],"lessons":[{"number":1,"title":"Pelayanan Paulus di Korintus","start_date":"27/06/2026","end_date":"03/07/2026"},{"number":2,"title":"Pesanan Salib","start_date":"04/07/2026","end_date":"10/07/2026"},{"number":3,"title":"Kesatuan dalam Kristus","start_date":"11/07/2026","end_date":"17/07/2026"},{"number":4,"title":"Dosa dalam Gereja","start_date":"18/07/2026","end_date":"24/07/2026"},{"number":5,"title":"Semuanya untuk Kemuliaan Tuhan","start_date":"25/07/2026","end_date":"31/07/2026"},{"number":6,"title":"Kurnia Rohani","start_date":"01/08/2026","end_date":"07/08/2026"},{"number":7,"title":"Potret Kasih","start_date":"08/08/2026","end_date":"14/08/2026"},{"number":8,"title":"Kuasa Kebangkitan Kristus","start_date":"15/08/2026","end_date":"21/08/2026"},{"number":9,"title":"Pelayanan Berpacu Kasih","start_date":"22/08/2026","end_date":"28/08/2026"},{"number":10,"title":"Pelayanan Kristian Tulen","start_date":"29/08/2026","end_date":"04/09/2026"},{"number":11,"title":"Penatalayanan dan Misi","start_date":"05/09/2026","end_date":"11/09/2026"},{"number":12,"title":"Menangani Guru-guru Palsu","start_date":"12/09/2026","end_date":"18/09/2026"},{"number":13,"title":"Rahmat, Kasih, dan Persekutuan","start_date":"19/09/2026","end_date":"25/09/2026"}]},{"id":"2026-01","title":"Menyatukan Syurga dan Bumi: Kristus dalam Filipi dan Kolose","description":"Fikirkan tentang pekerjaan paling sukar yang pernah anda lakukan. Apakah yang membuatkannya sukar? Adakah kerana jangkaan yang diletakkan, atau masa yang diperuntukkan, atau kedua-duanya? Adakah kerana sikap anda terhadap tugas itu? Atau mungkin kerana orang yang anda bekerjasama? Atau adakah kemungkinan kerana ia kelihatan mustahil untuk berjaya?","human_date":"Januari · Februari · Mac 2026","start_date":"27/12/2025","end_date":"27/03/2026","color_primary":"#2E4161","color_primary_dark":"#1E2C44","splash":true,"credits":[{"name":"Penyumbang Utama","value":"Clinton Wahlen"},{"name":"Penerbit Eksekutif","value":"Nelson G. Bendah, Kozal Watts Malim Enggang, Daven Lamam"},{"name":"Penterjemah","value":"Lesaya L. Sorudim, Rayners L. Sorudim"},{"name":"Pengarah Penerbitan","value":"Herbert Ginduk"},{"name":"Konsep Kulit/Rekacipta Dalaman","value":"Lesaya L. Sorudim"}],"lessons":[{"number":1,"title":"Dianiaya Tetapi Tidak Ditinggalkan","start_date":"27/12/2025","end_date":"02/01/2026"},{"number":2,"title":"Alasan untuk Bersyukur dan Berdoa","start_date":"03/01/2026","end_date":"09/01/2026"},{"number":3,"title":"Hidup dan Mati","start_date":"10/01/2026","end_date":"16/01/2026"},{"number":4,"title":"Kesatuan Melalui Kerendahan Hati","start_date":"17/01/2026","end_date":"23/01/2026"},{"number":5,"title":"Bersinar Seperti Lampu di Wahtu Malam","start_date":"24/01/2026","end_date":"30/01/2026"},{"number":6,"title":"Keyakinan Hanya pada Kristus","start_date":"31/01/2026","end_date":"06/02/2026"},{"number":7,"title":"Warganegara Syurgawi","start_date":"07/02/2026","end_date":"13/02/2026"},{"number":8,"title":"Keutamaan Kristus","start_date":"14/02/2026","end_date":"20/02/2026"},{"number":9,"title":"Pendamaian dan Harapan","start_date":"21/02/2026","end_date":"27/02/2026"},{"number":10,"title":"Lengkap dalam Kristus","start_date":"28/02/2026","end_date":"06/03/2026"},{"number":11,"title":"Hidup Bersama Kristus","start_date":"07/03/2026","end_date":"13/03/2026"},{"number":12,"title":"Hidup Bersama Satu Sama Lain","start_date":"14/03/2026","end_date":"20/03/2026"},{"number":13,"title":"Berdiri dalam Seluruh Kehendak Tuhan","start_date":"21/03/2026","end_date":"27/03/2026"}]},{"id":"2026-04","title":"Kurnia Nubuat","description":"Pakar Sains saraf telah mula memahami kemudahan menakjubkan pada bayi manusia dalam pemerolehan bahasa. Pada usia 6 bulan, bayi boleh memahami bunyi-bunyi yang membentuk perkataan Inggeris, atau perkataan daripada mana-mana 7,000 bahasa lisan yang lain. Jika terdedah kepada bahasa kedua, mereka juga boleh memperoleh bahasa tersebut. Dalam tempoh ini, pintu mental yang misteri terbuka, membolehkan bayi membezakan kira-kira 40 bunyi yang biasanya membentuk bahasa ibunda daripada 800 bunyi berbeza yang boleh mereka rasai semasa lahir. Tetapi ada satu perkara penting: bayi mesti diajak bercakap. Anda boleh memanggilnya pelajaran suara untuk bayi yang baru lahir.","human_date":"Oktober · November · Disember 2026","start_date":"26/09/2026","end_date":"25/12/2026","color_primary":"#5A2C32","color_primary_dark":"#541B23","splash":true,"credits":[{"name":"Penyumbang Utama","value":"Estte Ellen G. White"},{"name":"Pengarah Penerbitan","value":"Giftor Jepth Ginda"},{"name":"Penterjemah","value":"Lesaya L. Sorudim, Rayners L. Sorudim"},{"name":"Konsep Kulit/Rekacipta Dalaman","value":"Lesaya L. Sorudim"}],"lessons":[{"number":1,"title":"Pencipta Berfirman","start_date":"26/09/2026","end_date":"02/10/2026"},{"number":2,"title":"Panggilan Seorang Nabi","start_date":"03/10/2026","end_date":"09/10/2026"},{"number":3,"title":"Nabi Perjanjian Lama","start_date":"10/10/2026","end_date":"16/10/2026"},{"number":4,"title":"Nabi Perjanjian Baru","start_date":"17/10/2026","end_date":"23/10/2026"},{"number":5,"title":"Wahyu dan Inspirasi","start_date":"24/10/2026","end_date":"30/10/2026"},{"number":6,"title":"Tulisan Nubuat","start_date":"31/10/2026","end_date":"06/11/2026"},{"number":7,"title":"Dengarkanlah Ini!","start_date":"07/11/2026","end_date":"13/11/2026"},{"number":8,"title":"Mentafsirkan Tulisan Nubuat","start_date":"14/11/2026","end_date":"20/11/2026"},{"number":9,"title":"Menguji Para Nabi","start_date":"21/11/2026","end_date":"27/11/2026"},{"number":10,"title":"Autoriti dan Relevansi Nubuatan","start_date":"28/11/2026","end_date":"04/12/2026"},{"number":11,"title":"Manifestasi Nubuatan Pada Saat-saat Penting","start_date":"05/12/2026","end_date":"11/12/2026"},{"number":12,"title":"Wahyu Nubuatan Pada Akhir Zaman","start_date":"12/12/2026","end_date":"18/12/2026"},{"number":13,"title":"Berkat Daripada Firman Nubuat","start_date":"19/12/2026","end_date":"25/12/2026"}]}]}